// Settings UI (chat settings, api keys, providers, stages, agents, memory, skills, tools).

%locale: 
%namespace: settings

agent.add: Add new agent
agent.allow_context_shields: Allow context shields
agent.allow_context_shields.hint: If enabled, the agent will respect context shields and will not see messages placed after them.
agent.allow_summaries: Allow summaries
agent.allow_summaries.hint: If enabled, the agent will be able to see summaries of the earlier chat history and stop reading at summarized segments.
