agent.max_visible_rounds.hint: Limits how many recent conversation rounds (user message + assistant response) are visible to each agent. 0 means unlimited. Helps manage context window usage.
agent.memory.add_block: New block
agent.memory.attach: Attach
agent.memory.attach.placeholder: Existing block...
agent.memory.block_warning_no_content: Facts and logs are disabled for this block. The agent cannot read or write any memory to it.
agent.memory.blocks: Memory blocks
agent.memory.blocks.hint: Attach shared memory blocks to this agent. A block stores semantic facts, episodic logs and persistent state. Select a block in the list to edit its contents below.
