agent.mentions.can_be_mentioned.hint: Whether the agent can be mentioned by other agents and users, causing it to execute.
agent.mentions.can_mention_others: Can mention others
agent.mentions.can_mention_others.hint: Whether the agent can mention and trigger other agents.
agent.promote_global: Promote to global
agent.read_filter: Agent filter
agent.read_filter.hint: Restricts which agents this agent can see based on whitelist or blacklist.
agent.read_permissions: Read permissions
agent.read_permissions.hint: Controls what types of messages and content this agent can read in the chat.
agent.remove: Remove agent
agent.skills.injection_mode: Injection
agent.skills.skill_list: Skill Overrides
agent.skills.skill_list.hint: Override skill settings for this agent. Disabled skills are excluded from the prompt. Toggle injection mode to include full skill body in the system prompt.
